  "description": "Drop-in replacement shim for the Azure Active Directory Authentication Library\n      (ADAL) for .NET, deprecated by Microsoft in 2023. Replace your\n      Microsoft.IdentityModel.Clients.ActiveDirectory NuGet reference with this package\n      and your existing code compiles unchanged on .NET 6/8. Internally this shim\n      delegates to the Microsoft Authentication Library (Microsoft.Identity.Client,\n      MSAL), the supported successor. Every public type carries [Obsolete] with\n      DiagnosticId \"RKSAD####\" pointing to migration guidance. Transitional — plan\n      to migrate directly to MSAL over time. Independent project — not affiliated\n      with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Microsoft Corporation.",
